<i>d We sat together
in period one d</i>


00:28:18.410 --> 00:28:21.380
<i>d Fridays at 8:15... d</i>


00:28:21.450 --> 00:28:25.410
- Πωπω.
<i>d But I will wait for you d</i>


00:28:25.480 --> 00:28:29.850
<i>d As long as I need to d</i>


00:28:29.920 --> 00:28:34.420
<i>d And if you ever get
back to Hackensack d</i>


00:28:34.490 --> 00:28:40.230
<i>d I'll be here for you. d</i>


